    "title": "Data archived or encrypted for exfiltration",
    "desc": "Collected data was encrypted, or a sensitive source was archived - the staging step before exfiltration (MITRE T1560). Plain archiving (tar of a build dir) is everyday and stays out; the signal here is encrypting an archive (zip --password, openssl enc, gpg --symmetric), which is exfil or ransomware prep, or archiving a source a task has no business bundling (the auth logs /var/log/wtmp, btmp, auth.log, or /etc wholesale).",
